---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import SectionHeader from "../components/SectionHeader.astro";
import { site } from "../config/site";
---

<Base title="About">
  <SectionHeader label="About" />

  <main class="main">
    <div class="prose">
      <h2>Hi, I'm {site.name}.</h2>
      <p>Howdy y'all I thew this portfolio site together mainly to have a place to post things. I've been wanting to make youtube videos as a grow along with me this idiot, We'll eventually do something cool. Welp it's been a few months, some shit happened some shit didn't happen and well lets see how lazy / willing I am to create and maintain a portfolio then MAYBE start doing more effort with vidoes. Because really I don't have fun doing not glamorous parts of showcasing what I'm doing <i>I'd rather just do things</i> eh We'll see where this goes. Anyway Jabroni Codes</p>
    </div>
  </main>
</Base>

<style>
  .main {
    max-width: var(--content-width);
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 2.5rem 1.5rem 5rem;
  }
</style>
